/-- **The Nieuwland number of `Johnson.Disphenocingulum.polyhedron`, by representatives**: `ν Johnson.Disphenocingulum.polyhedron` lies in `[k, k + 1] / 10 ^ 30`, and it is the first coordinate of the root of each of finitely many systems of integer polynomial equations, each in a rational box of all its variables and each with exactly one root in its box (`IsPolyRootEq`, `Modules/System/PolyRootEq.lean`); the systems are those of `johnsonDisphenocingulum_nu_reps_list`. -/
theorem johnsonDisphenocingulum_nu_reps :
    ν Johnson.Disphenocingulum.polyhedron ∈ Set.Icc ((1019753943915324130443625714496 : ℝ) / 10 ^ 30) ((1019753943915324130443625714497 : ℝ) / 10 ^ 30) ∧
